WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:16.950
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.350
Fukiko-sama... <b> </b>

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:19.220
Fukiko-sama... Eh??

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:26.220
I've been waiting...!

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:28.390
All this time... all this time...

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:31.990
I knew you would someday keep your promise to me!

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:34.210
Oh, Fukiko-sama!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:37.280
No! I'm not her!

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:40.580
It's just as you told me then...

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.780
...you've come here so we can... die together...

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:45.620
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:47.680
...you said... we could die together...

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:54.930
She's mad! She's gone completely mad!

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:57.310
Brother...!

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:03.350
<b>14. The Secret Door</b>

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:06.180
I'm not her! Look at me closely!

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:08.390
I'm not Miya-sama!

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:10.020
Fukiko-sama!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.890
No! I'm not her!

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.140
Fukiko-sama... why...?

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.870
Why, Fukiko-sama?

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:26.020
She's heavily drugged again...!

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.710
You said we could die together.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:33.160
Look... here is the bracelet, still.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:38.190
It never left my wrist since the day you gave it to me... just as you wished.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:48.050
So now... finally, you came to die with me, after all...

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:53.180
There is nothing good to be said of Life.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:04:00.950
Rather, let us die -- and dwell together in eternity.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:08.320
The truth is this... that nothing can give any kind of meaning to life.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.740
Now, Fukiko-sama!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.170
Now it's your turn!

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:29.390
Stop!

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.040
Fukiko-sama!

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.880
Saint-Juste-sama! Saint-Juste-sama!

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:49.360
I'm not her! I'm not Miya-sama!

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:01.450
Don't be afraid.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:04.060
I'll help you...

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:06.410
I'll lend you all my strength...

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:23.750
I'm not her! I'm not her!

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:25.730
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:30.860
It's just me!

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:33.060
Misonoo Nanako!

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:35.950
It's me! It's just me!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:54.760
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:37.320
Brother, my Dear Brother...

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:44.320
I looked into Rei's deranged Fukiko-obsessed eyes...

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:49.440
...but I think I saw there... something...

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:52.180
...something more like love... than hate.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:57.960
You said we could die together.

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:02.970
See, here is the bracelet still, just as you wished it.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:10.490
And the scar... what if that scar...

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:16.420
...what if it is from a double-suicide attempt with Miya-sama?

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:31.730
Good morning!

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:32.270
Good morning! Good morning!

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:32.940
Good morning! <b> </b>

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:33.480
Good morning! Good morning!

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:34.080
Good morning!

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:36.680
Good morning!

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:46.010
Saint-Juste-sama is out today, of course.

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:50.060
How is it that I find you here?

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:55.720
What business would a freshman have here in a senior's room?

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:57.740
Ummmm... well...

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:02.400
Your absences from the cram sessions are becoming conspicuous.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.420
I know. I'm sincerely sorry.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:08.300
I'll be certain to attend from now on.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:09.350
...but... <b> </b> <b> </b>

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:12.100
...but... You must study especially hard right now.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:14.770
There's not much time left.

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:16.520
I will!

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:19.820
So you won't have time to be snooping around...

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:21.230
...into other people's affairs...

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:24.950
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.720
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:32.450
Are you here?

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:34.770
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:44.260
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:46.270
Saint-Juste-sama...!

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:53.850
Such a pleasant sleep...

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:56.320
...thanks to my little pills.

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:58.580
You're still taking these drugs?

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:02.760
No! Don't!

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:06.120
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:25.980
Ummm... maybe it would be wise to lock your door,

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:29.530
...at least when you are asleep, I would think...

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:34.310
Any stranger, or thief, could come right in.

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:38.770
They can take whatever they want. Anything.

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:42.230
Even my life.

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:02.290
Oh no, it's slipped my mind!

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:04.360
The year Shakespeare was born...!

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:10.220
It's 1564... and he died in 1616.

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:12.000
I give up!

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:16.350
It's easy... just remember "He wrote many plays about murder." See?

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:20.460
<i>"Hito goroshi?"</i> 1-5-6-4...

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:24.140
Oh! Did you get that from the sorority cram session?

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:25.260
Sure!

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:27.000
You're so lucky...

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:30.010
Yes, but I have heavy responsibilities, too.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:32.890
You sure do. And lots of pressure!

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.740
Say, do you have a cram session today, too?

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:40.680
No, from now on we do self-study only.

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:41.500
Oh? <b> </b>

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.040
Oh? There's only five days left!

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:45.960
The Big Sisters have their own mid-terms to study for.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:49.110
Oh! Let's... let's study together then!

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.450
Um... mmmm...

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:53.720
You started doing it again. <b> </b>

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:54.390
You started doing it again. What?

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:57.070
Doing "Nanako has a secret."

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:59.220
That's OK. See you later!

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:12.580
Baroque music was played from the 17th century to the mid-18th century.

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:17.480
The main composers in that style were Georg Friedrich Handel, Johann Sebastian Bach, and Antonio Vivaldi.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.350
So then, I'll make a cheesecake.

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:28.570
And then... I'll make something from that roast beef I have...

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:36.390
You'd better copy that down! They say it'll be on the test.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:37.980
OK.

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:50.290
Misonoo-San! Excuse me!

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:58.960
Aw... I was hoping... that she'd help me with my French.

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:03.050
You should have come earlier!

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:05.200
Oh! Kaoru-no-Kimi!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:07.710
So what's this about Misonoo-san?

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:11.530
Ummm... yes, she's just not been herself lately...

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:16.520
Daydreaming all day... not even a "goodbye" when she leaves for home.

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:23.430
Well, maybe my French will do, after all...

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:24.170
Huh?

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:26.550
As for today...

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:29.640
...if you'll accept me as Misonoo-san's substitute...

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:33.470
Oh, yes! Kaoru-no-Kimi!

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:36.880
Thank you! It starts on page 57... <b> </b>

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:37.690
Thank you! It starts on page 57... Yes, yes...

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:48.480
How is it? My cheesecake?

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:49.830
Mmmm.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.610
The roast beef sandwich is good too!

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:55.280
It's in the kitchen...

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:05.810
Now, now, Saint-Juste-sama...

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.090
What are you doing?

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:00.280
Give them back!

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.220
You mustn't!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.200
Stay the hell outta my business!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:13.040
Get out! I didn't ask for this!

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:17.350
I hate prying nuisances like you!

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:40.580
Stay the hell outta my business!

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:43.920
I hate prying nuisances like you!

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:55.700
But... but I just don't think it's right...

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:58.990
...to ruin one's health with drugs like that...

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:02.950
I'm absolutely convinced of it.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:09.220
But... I won't be able to visit her apartment ever again.

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.590
Get out! I didn't ask for this!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:53.360
How long has it been since I came to look at the sea...?

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:03.770
Here.

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.190
You didn't have to accompany me home.

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:09.730
Mid-terms begin tomorrow, right?

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:12.480
You even brought that with you.

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:15.740
But...

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:20.650
No more drugs for me today.

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:23.450
I promise.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.190
Ma cherie La Poupee...

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:27.160
You're calling me that again...

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:33.640
What could it be about the doll?

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:37.720
Is there some memory behind it?

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:45.610
I'll be going. <b> </b>

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:46.350
I'll be going. OK.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:57.510
What is it that reflects from within those eyes...?

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:03.020
How can... Who can possibly fathom their meaning, my Dear Brother...?

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:18.160
Are you...?

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:23.510
Umm... oh... we met somewhere...

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.390
From cram school. Remember?

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.070
Hey! Henmi!

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:35.960
Oh, yes, that was it!

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:40.070
Sorry...

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:41.490
That's OK.

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:44.830
Do you... still get letters from Henmi?

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:47.930
Mmm... yes... I do!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:52.330
Really? He hardly ever writes letters!

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:56.060
Excuse me, but do you live in this apartment?

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:59.610
Uh... no, a friend of mine does.

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:02.370
Ah... Here it is...

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:04.430
Well, good-bye...

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.100
Bye

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.510
Your "friend"...?

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:27.360
Oh no! My flash cards!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.930
Oh well, I'll be OK without them.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.370
It's raining.

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:44.720
Yes...

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:49.140
Does she come here often?

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:51.560
More often than you do...

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.570
What do you want?

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:58.050
I wanted to see how you're doing.

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.910
What a nice surprise.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.700
Are you still smoking?

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:12.960
You'd better quit. It's not good for you.

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:34.960
My dear Brother...

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:41.660
I regret saying this, but this must remain a S-E-C-R-E-T.

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:02.990
Tomoko!

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:06.780
You're as late as hell! I thought I'd miss the train!

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:08.990
I can't be late for the tests!

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:11.670
And I still have so much to memorize!

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:17.770
Shakespeare... "wrote many books on kidnapping."

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:21.250
Geez, Tomoko! Not "kidnapping"...!

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:24.470
Then it's <i>"hito bashira"</i>...? No? What then...?

00:22:33.210 --> 00:22:35.280
I have to buy an eraser!

00:22:35.280 --> 00:22:38.300
See you later! Good luck!

00:22:38.630 --> 00:22:39.510
Thanks!

00:22:48.690 --> 00:22:49.830
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:52.380
Here...

00:23:00.800 --> 00:23:02.070
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:04.610
Oh!! Saint-Juste-sama!

00:23:05.720 --> 00:23:08.200
Are you feeling well now?

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:10.210
Now, this is unusual!

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:13.510
You showed up for the first day of mid-terms!

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:17.800
What's with you?

00:23:18.090 --> 00:23:21.300
Why should I force the teachers to give me make-up exams every term?

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:22.840
That's all.

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:41.800
My dear Brother...

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:44.440
Mid-terms have begun.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:01.560 --> 00:25:05.110
Preview

00:25:05.790 --> 00:25:10.750
Nanako is badly shaken to learn Fukiko's secret truth...

00:25:10.770 --> 00:25:14.440
...regarding Nanako's admission into the Sorority.

00:25:14.900 --> 00:25:17.980
Then a Sorority party is held aboard a yacht,

00:25:17.980 --> 00:25:20.260
...and Fukiko has yet another surprise for Nanako.

00:25:21.560 --> 00:25:22.640
Next episode: <b> </b> <b> </b>

00:25:22.640 --> 00:25:24.780
Next episode: <b>Fukiko; The Sea Rumbles</b>

00:25:25.090 --> 00:25:26.690
Brother, Dear Brother... <b> </b>

00:25:26.710 --> 00:25:29.370
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
